RTAB-Map is a graph-based mapping and localization library from IntRoLab.
This headless CPU profile uses shared OpenCV 5, Eigen 5, PCL 1.15.1,
GTSAM 4.3.0 and SQLite 3.54.0 with GCC 16.2.0.
The bundled utilite component is LGPL-3.0-or-later; original notices remain.
Qt, ROS, live devices and optional noncommercial/GPL algorithms are disabled.
